Unit proof for strip_string over all strings up to length 3 (no
leading/trailing whitespace; idempotence).  Was blocked by
cpp11_self_pointer_move_return (std::string returned by value read a
dead object); verifies since the elide_cpp_returned_temporaries
lowering constructs returned temporaries directly in caller storage.
KNOWNBUG (scaling limit): the proof needs about 3.1 GB and 75 s (MiniSat,
x86_64), above the 2.5 GB CBMC_TEST_MEMLIMIT of the CI jobs.
